の。ほっほっほ…","nextNodeIds":[730470102]},{"nodeId":730470102,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":1706115714,"text":"アランラジャ、なんだか楽しそうだな！","nextNodeIds":[730470103]},{"nodeId":730470103,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20648,"speakerName":"アランラジャ","textMapHash":487481562,"text":"ほっほっほ…こんなにたくさんのアランナラが帰ってきてくれて、ヴァナラーナがにぎやかになって本当に楽しいんじゃよ。いやはや、ワシ自身がウツァヴ祭に参加できるとは思わなんだ…","nextNodeIds":[730470104,730470105]},{"nodeId":730470104,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":1649668514,"text":"参加したことなかったの？","nextNodeIds":[730470107]},{"nodeId":730470107,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20648,"speakerName":"アランラジャ","textMapHash":3525723762,"text":"ワシの物語の中で、かつて一度だけ参加したことがある。ただ、それはずいぶんと昔の物語じゃ…","nextNodeIds":[730470108]},{"nodeId":730470108,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20648,"speakerName":"アランラジャ","textMapHash":1313159642,"text":"ワシ、アランムフクンダ、アランラナ、アランジ…ワシらは多くのアランナラ、そしてナラヴァルナと共にウツァヴ祭を祝った。","nextNodeIds":[730470109]},{"nodeId":730470109,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20648,"speakerName":"アランラジャ","textMapHash":4095833778,"text":"それはとても辛い時期じゃった。じゃが、ウツァヴ祭の間だけは、みんな笑って歌っておった。ワシはこの物語が大好きじゃ。","nextNodeIds":[730470110]},{"nodeId":730470110,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":3822206154,"text":"あれ？だったらアランラジャは参加したことがあるんじゃないか…？","nextNodeIds":[730470111]},{"nodeId":730470111,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20648,"speakerName":"アランラジャ","textMapHash":3030624954,"text":"うむ、物語の中では、確かに参加した。ただし、ワシはもう覚えておらん。その物語は、アランラナたちが後でワシに教えてくれたものじゃ。","nextNodeIds":[730470112]},{"nodeId":730470112,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":1088364658,"text":"うーん…アランラジャの話し方って、お爺ちゃんみたいだな。つまり、歳を取ったせいで忘れちゃったんだな！","nextNodeIds":[730470113]},{"nodeId":730470113,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20648,"speakerName":"アランラジャ","textMapHash":2512876810,"text":"#それで間違ってはおらぬかもしれん…ときにナラ{NICKNAME}、パイモン、これを受け取ってくれんか？","nextNodeIds":[730470114]},{"nodeId":730470114,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":3333528402,"text":"小さな花…","nextNodeIds":[730470115]},{"nodeId":730470115,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20648,"speakerName":"アランラジャ","textMapHash":1973572530,"text":"うむ。未来への旅の途中、この花がおヌシらと共にあらんことを。","nextNodeIds":[730470116,730470117]},{"nodeId":730470116,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":1727252194,"text":"ありがたく受け取るよ。","nextNodeIds":[730470118]},{"nodeId":730470118,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20648,"speakerName":"アランラジャ","textMapHash":2712794474,"text":"ナラの時間はアランナラに比べあまりに貴重じゃ。これ以上足止めはできん。楽しんでいっておくれ。あとアランカヴィを訪ねてやってほしい。ウツァヴ祭の儀式の準備をしているはずじゃ。","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":730470117,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":3748555930,"text":"ありがとう。","nextNodeIds":[730470118]},{"nodeId":730470105,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":1163440210,"text":"#{M#俺}{F#私}も楽しいよ。","nextNodeIds":[730470106]},{"nodeId":730470106,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":3951830690,"text":"オイラも楽しいぜ！でも、アランラジャは今までウツァヴ祭に参加したことなかったんだな？","nextNodeIds":[730470107]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[7304701,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"triggerCond":[],"execActions":[],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_NONE","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDLNFDCEJLG":"QUEST_GUIDE_AREA_STYLE_DEFAULT","KCFINIEBBBG":0,"KEDGDANLBHP":"","KNMAMMFJAOB":"QUEST_GUIDE_STYLE_NONE","LNHLPKELCAL":[],"NOCCOBOFKHP":0,"OFEBJNGBEPL":"QUEST_GUIDE_AUTO_NONE","PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_GUIDE_NONE"}}}],"unmappedTalks":[],"questNarration":[],"talkIds":[7304701],"speakerCounts":[{"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20648,"speakerName":"アランラジャ",